  "description": "Comic Distress is a bold and energetic cartoon display font featuring a unique distressed texture that adds vintage comic charm to every project. Designed with thick rounded characters and playful proportions, this font is ideal for creating eye-catching headlines, branding, children’s products, comic book covers, posters, packaging, logos, social media graphics, stickers, t-shirts, and print-on-demand designs.\nWhether you’re designing for kids, retro pop art, cartoons, games, or fun branding, Comic Distress delivers a vibrant and expressive personality that instantly grabs attention.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Comic Distress is a bold and energetic cartoon display font featuring a unique distressed texture that adds vintage comic charm to every project. Designed with thick rounded characters and playful proportions, this font is ideal for creating eye-catching headlines, branding, children’s products, comic book covers, posters, packaging, logos, social media graphics, stickers, t-shirts, and print-on-demand designs.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re designing for kids, retro pop art, cartoons, games, or fun branding, Comic Distress delivers a vibrant and expressive personality that instantly grabs attention.</p>",
